DTEND:20251020T004500Z
DTSTAMP:20251019T230000Z
UID:k8dEpHtohO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 87 mins (1h27m)\n\nSIFF DocFest Follow trailblazing 
 trans icon and activist Peppermint’s rise from a struggling Harlem queen
  to history-making turns on RuPaul’s Drag Race and Broadway\, in this do
 cumentary that pulls back the curtain on fame\, transition\, and the cost 
 of living in the spotlight as a Black trans woman. Director Oriel Pe’er 
 scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/docfest/a
 -deeper-love-the-story-of-miss-peppermint\n\nEstimated start: 23:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
